4\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186358822} {:answer/id #uuid "9d9fc56e-3bd4-556b-93b9-3cef3823bc77" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-\\operatorname{coth}⁡x-4\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186359128}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186359128} :answer-field/id #uuid "3d4f756a-6070-5de7-9831-5fb568e49df7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186360080}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "0bd3b030-22be-5bf9-8f81-05d6c5d82a11" :question/math-academy-id "q-96056" :question/problem "$\\int ({csch}^{2}⁡x-4{sech}^{2}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x)={sech}^{2}⁡x & \\,⇒\\,\\int {sech}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x+C, \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{coth}⁡x)=-{csch}^{2}⁡x & \\,⇒\\,\\int {csch}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=-\\operatorname{coth}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ({csch}^{2}⁡x-4{sech}^{2}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int {csch}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x-4\\int {sech}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{coth}⁡x-4\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} :step/id #uuid "fd35000b-7e0c-574d-a60e-f261c0e0cc6c"}] :activity/title "Integrating Hyperbolic Functions" :activity/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045464 :db/ident :activity.type/review} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539473}]}
